{"unit_id":"pengpenglele__dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code#card-zh","repo":"pengpenglele/dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code","commit":"7b1a70a24248dad3595059d675329c57fc8c1193","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-go-x-session 是一款面向 DSH 的 OpenCode Go 请求适配插件。它在模型流请求中捕获当前会话标识，并在后续网络请求中补入 x-opencode-session 请求头，覆盖 OpenCode Go 路由以及自动审查等没有直接 sessionId 的调用。插件默认只处理 opencode-go* 路由和 opencode.ai 主机，可配置路由、主机、备用会话标识、日志开关，并支持运行时启停。适合使用 OpenCode Go 且遇到会话请求头缺失的 DSH 用户；需要配置 OpenCode Go 自身的凭据和 endpoint。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:264-274","index.js:331-345","index.js:445-467"]}
{"unit_id":"pengpenglele__dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code#card-en","repo":"pengpenglele/dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code","commit":"7b1a70a24248dad3595059d675329c57fc8c1193","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-opencode-go-x-session adds x-opencode-session to configured OpenCode Go requests, including auto-review calls. It captures the conversation ID during streaming. Defaults target opencode-go* routes on opencode.ai; route, host, fallback ID, and live enablement are configurable.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:264-274","index.js:331-345","index.js:445-467"]}
