{"unit_id":"pengpenglele__dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code#feature-1","repo":"pengpenglele/dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code","commit":"7b1a70a24248dad3595059d675329c57fc8c1193","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-go-x-session 的功能「为模型请求添加会话头」：匹配的 llm/stream 调用会捕获会话 ID，并由 fetch 包装器在目标请求缺少该头时添加 x-opencode-session。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:331-345","index.js:445-467"]}
{"unit_id":"pengpenglele__dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code#feature-2","repo":"pengpenglele/dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code","commit":"7b1a70a24248dad3595059d675329c57fc8c1193","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-go-x-session 的功能「自动审查会话关联」：当请求本身没有 sessionId 时，可从当前 initiator 会话取得标识；仍不可用时使用配置的备用 ID。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:241-253","index.js:264-274"]}
{"unit_id":"pengpenglele__dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code#feature-3","repo":"pengpenglele/dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code","commit":"7b1a70a24248dad3595059d675329c57fc8c1193","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-go-x-session 的功能「路由与主机范围配置」：通过 provider 前缀或精确路由及主机允许列表，限定哪些模型请求可以接收会话头。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:186-209","index.js:96-115"]}
{"unit_id":"pengpenglele__dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code#feature-4","repo":"pengpenglele/dsh-opencode-go-x-session-code","commit":"7b1a70a24248dad3595059d675329c57fc8c1193","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-go-x-session 的功能「运行时开关与调试日志」：设置变更会同步启停 fetch 包装器；启用 debug 后会记录注入的请求头和目标 URL。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:419-443","index.js:382-400"]}
